'' TWO MODULES THAT BOTH USE A TYPE WITH A VIRTUAL METHOD LINK. Each emits the
'' type's vtable (_ZTV) and RTTI record (_ZTS); fbc makes both module-local ('static',
'' llvm-nm 'd', measured 2026-09-26) and tiko emitted them strong, so this pair failed
'' with "lld-link: duplicate symbol: vtable for B" and "typeinfo name for B".
''
'' THE PROGRAM IS RUN TOO, and its output is fbc's, line for line (measured
'' 2026-09-26): dispatch and 'is D' tested in the module that did NOT create the
'' object, and the other way round, over two modules' own copies of the tables.
'' The internal linkage itself is pinned in IR by vtable-internal.test.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/driver/src/vtable-two-a.bas tests/driver/src/vtable-two-b.bas -o tests/driver/vtabletwo.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-NOT: duplicate symbol
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/driver/vtabletwo.exe
'' RUN: tests/driver/vtabletwo.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 1              2
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 2            -1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 1             0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 2            -1
